13:["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","section","The stand is only half the setup",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The stand is only half the setup"}],[["$","p","Raising a laptop screen usually makes the built-in keyboard too high or too far away for comfortable extended use. Plan on an external keyboard and pointing device when the stand is used at a desk.",{"children":"Raising a laptop screen usually makes the built-in keyboard too high or too far away for comfortable extended use. Plan on an external keyboard and pointing device when the stand is used at a desk."}],["$","p","If you need to type directly on the laptop, prioritize a low, stable angle rather than maximum height.",{"children":"If you need to type directly on the laptop, prioritize a low, stable angle rather than maximum height."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Four checks before buying",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Four checks before buying"}],[["$","p","Measure the laptop and the available desk depth first.",{"children":"Measure the laptop and the available desk depth first."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","The platform supports the laptop's size and weight with margin to spare.",{"children":"The platform supports the laptop's size and weight with margin to spare."}],["$","li","The adjustment joints resist movement without requiring awkward tools.",{"children":"The adjustment joints resist movement without requiring awkward tools."}],["$","li","The front lip is low enough not to press into wrists or obstruct ports.",{"children":"The front lip is low enough not to press into wrists or obstruct ports."}],["$","li","The platform does not block the laptop's intake or exhaust vents.",{"children":"The platform does not block the laptop's intake or exhaust vents."}]]}]]}],["$","section","Fixed, adjustable, or folding",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Fixed, adjustable, or folding"}],[["$","p","A fixed stand is often the most stable and may be enough for a permanent desk. An adjustable arm offers more flexibility but needs a strong hinge and a larger footprint. Folding stands travel well but vary widely in stiffness.",{"children":"A fixed stand is often the most stable and may be enough for a permanent desk. An adjustable arm offers more flexibility but needs a strong hinge and a larger footprint. Folding stands travel well but vary widely in stiffness."}],["$","p","Rubber contact pads should grip without covering vents, and replacement pads are a useful sign that the design is meant to last.",{"children":"Rubber contact pads should grip without covering vents, and replacement pads are a useful sign that the design is meant to last."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
